<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 20.02 to 6955.48.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 0.67 to 418.37.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.07.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1626 to 843.</p>
<p>Volume was 494,430,120 compared with 486,928,590 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
